 "summary": "JUMO tecLine sensors are amperometric membrane sensors for free and total chlorine, chlorine dioxide, ozone, hydrogen peroxide, peracetic acid and bromine, with a built-in RS-485 Modbus RTU interface. This map covers concentration, cell current and temperature, the unit and decimal settings, calibration zero/slope with history, device identification and serial settings.",
